alf suppression after controlling for H1 PPP / mean reversion.", "observed_result": "Test B: all BH-adjusted null/WEAK (PNR ATT=+0.0313 BH_p=0.0658 WEAK; others NULL). Test C top-1 acc=0.550 vs mean-reversion baseline 0.511 (+0.039) vs most-used 0.239. Test A PULL_UP slope -0.0581 p=0.0030; CUT -0.0917 p [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Matched ATT does not survive BH; predictive lift over mean reversion is only +0.039 (0.550 vs 0.511). Bulk of H2 suppression is RTM.", "observed_sample_and_power": "n=8873 team-games; Test C test n=1008"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:RTM_SELECTION"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-005", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-005: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)", "score": 0.229, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-APPA-005 (0.23)"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "Playoff defenses change scheme within games and between games, especially after the opponent ran a play type heavily.", "observed_result": "Within-game change 319/523 (61.0%); cross-game change 298/440 (67.7%); 103/104 units (99.0%) and 52/52 series show a change; transition matrices near-uniform.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Doc caveat: inferred label cannot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.", "observed_sample_and_power": "523 cells; 440 pairs", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:label_or_classification_error"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:LABEL_ERROR"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-010", "label": "Study family SF-APPS-010: Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets", "score": 0.194, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPS-070 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF-APPS-010", "request matches LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean (0.34); FAM:SF-APPS-010 auto_limited_by LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets", "auto_outcome_status": "inconclusive", "observed_hypothesis": "Play-type PPP (especially DRIVE) declines as a playoff series progresses, so DRIVE is a good early-series call.", "observed_result": "DRIVE 0.889 -> 0.949 (+0.060); CUT +0.114; PNR +0.087; PULL_UP -0.077; POST_UP -0.032.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "'NO CLEAR SIGNAL - DRIVE PPP is stable or improves across the series'; observational with selection caveats.", "observed_sample_and_power": "1197 records; no CIs", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_method": "Pooled (series, team, PT, bucket) records (1197), EARLY G1-2 / MID G3-4 / LATE G5-7, min 10 poss, min 3 series.", "observed_verdict": "null", "observed_failure_type": "E_unclear"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean"}]}], "n_results": 4}

